Pipe A alone fills a tank in 6 hours. Pipe B alone fills the same tank in 12 hours. Both pipes are opened together for 2 hours, then Pipe A is turned off and Pipe B continues alone until the tank is full. How many total hours does it take to fill the tank from the moment both pipes were first opened?

